OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMahmood expected to announce changes to
OL,4,Arules around indefinite leave to remain
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe home secretary was concerned about
OL,7,Fthe number of people who would be
OL,8,Feligible for permanent residency after
OL,9,Fa period of very high net migration
OL,10,Funder the previous government.
OL,12,FMahmood has faced opposition from
OL,13,Fwithin the government for proposing to
OL,14,Fimpose new rules on migrant workers
OL,15,Falready in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
